# J extends the selection over the heading into the next day's group, and x completes both entries.
file <<END
- A1 @due({today+1})
- B2 @due({today+2})
- C1 @due({today+1})
- D3 @due({today+3})
END
keys gU j J x
see ✔ C1
see ✔ B2
quit
saved <<END
- A1 @due({today+1})
- B2 @due({today+2}) @done({today})
- C1 @due({today+1}) @done({today})
- D3 @due({today+3})
END
